# Docs and tests stay current

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

When behavior changes, update the matching docs (README, `docs/content/`, component READMEs) and tests in the same work. Use GitHub-relative markdown links, not `/docs/...` website paths. Do not leave guides describing replaced stacks, versions, install URLs, or commands.

Always use Conventional Commits (`<type>(<scope>): <summary>`) and DCO sign-off. See `.cursor/rules/git-commits.mdc`.
